          <commentary>0.5, 2, A이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>0.5 2 B</choice_text>
          <commentary>비교우위국이 틀렸다.</commentary>
