        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>5원</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 경제학개론 · 한계비용 계산
정답은 ②이다. 총비용 = 평균비용 × 생산량이다. 9개일 때 6 × 9 = 54원, 10개일 때 5.9 × 10 = 59원이므로 10번째 볼펜의 한계비용 = 59 − 54 = 5원이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>1원</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산값과 다르다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>5원</choice_text>
          <commentary>5원이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>5.9원</choice_text>
          <commentary>평균비용이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>6원</choice_text>
